  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project support for the implementation of Burkina Faso&apos;s National Health Plan in a delegated cooperation with the Netherlands as the lead agency. The overall objective is to increase the capacity at regional and district level to which 70% of the funds are distributed.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till genomf&#xf6;randet av Burkina Fasos nationella h&#xe4;lsoplan. Insatsen genomf&#xf6;rs i &quot;projektform&quot; i ett delegerat partnerskap med Nederl&#xe4;nderna med fokus p&#xe5; kapacitetsf&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringar s&#xe4;rskilt p&#xe5; distriktsniv&#xe5; dit ca 70% av pengarna kanaliseras.</narrative>
  </description>
